    <em>"Defranceski, Lerena, Taylor, Barry, Blazevic, Booyzen"</em>, 15,643 people. Read
    <b>9 September 2026</b> from David Defranceski's account.</p>
  <p class="cap">The tree is private and its profile pages are not publicly linkable. Everything taken from
    it is reproduced here with its own citation where it carries one, and marked as uncited where it does
    not. MyHeritage interface marks — confirmed Smart Matches, direct-ancestor stars — are
    <b>not</b> treated as sources. <a href={u("/method/")}>Method &rarr;</a></p>
</section>

